emains sidelined on the IL, but we continue to track progress for the rest of our roster, including **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, **Gunnar Henderson**, **Jordan Westburg**, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, **Jacob Wilson**, **Jorge Polanco**, **Nasim Nunez**, **Heliot Ramos**, **Coby Mayo**, **Curtis Mead**, **Wade Meckler**, and **Denzer Guzman** as potential depth options.",
